	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "ApXsbKxNWCNmtJPvg",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 0, DX 0, IQ 0, HT 11, HP 10, WILL 6, PER 8, FP 11, SPEED 2.75, MOVE 0, DODGE —, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AOEhHgJg-H782ZWGB",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 1 (offense -5, protection -2), threat tier minor, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "AbotXXvK2IuAmAXMX",
			"text": "Shriek (alarm, no damage), reach 4-yard emanation: Not an attack. Movement within 4 yards, once sensed by the fungus's Vibration Sense (Air), triggers a piercing 10-second sound that imposes -8 to Hearing on everyone within 4 yards. It deals no damage and allows no defense because there is nothing to defend against; its danger is that it attracts whatever lives nearby. The shrieker is sessile, blind, deaf and mute and cannot pursue or harm anyone."
		},
		{
			"id": "ATKwDsnZSPMgD2Cmj",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/shrieker.gct"
		},
